msgid ""
"License entered successfully!\n"
"For all changes to take effect NVDA must be restarted.\n"
"Do you want to restart NVDA now?"
msgstr ""
"¡Licencia introducida satisfactoriamente!\n"
"Para que todos los cambios tengan efecto NVDA debe reiniciarse.\n"
"¿Quieres reiniciar ahora NVDA?"

